      "blocks": {
        "heading_64CmHz": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "Why Own an Indoor Exercise Bike at Home?",
            "heading_tag": "h1",
            "text_color": "",
            "gradient": ""
          }
        },
        "richtext_XckabJ": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>An indoor exercise bike lets you stay active anytime, eliminating the need for a gym or worrying about the weather. It provides a smooth, low-impact workout that strengthens your lower body, enhances cardiovascular health, and increases stamina. Whether your goal is weight loss, endurance building, or simply staying fit, cycling is an effective way to burn calories and boost metabolism. Plus, it’s gentle on the joints, making it perfect for all fitness levels. Enjoy a convenient, stress-relieving workout right from the comfort of home!</p>"
          }
        }
      },
