    "faq_zcGELp": {
      "type": "faq",
      "blocks": {
        "item_Khf3Qz": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Stable & Comfortable Ride for Long Workouts",
            "content": "<p>The Merach Indoor Exercise Bike is designed with user comfort in mind. Featuring an ergonomic seat, an adjustable seat height, and a soft, supportive cushion, it provides a smooth and enjoyable riding experience. Whether you're cycling for a short session or an extended workout, the bike ensures proper posture and reduces strain on your body, allowing you to focus on building endurance and strength without discomfort.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_3HRCNH": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Stay Motivated with the Merach Smart App",
            "content": "<p>Boredom is no longer an excuse! The Merach app brings a dynamic and engaging workout experience with virtual scenic rides, real-time performance tracking, and challenge competitions. Whether you want to simulate outdoor cycling routes or compete with friends, the smart app keeps you entertained and motivated, making every workout fun and immersive.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_CTQX6y": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Sturdy, Safe & Built to Perform",
            "content": "<p>A solid triangle frame design enhances stability and durability, ensuring a safe and secure riding experience even during high-intensity workouts. The robust construction supports various resistance levels, making it suitable for both beginners and experienced riders. With smooth, quiet operation, it’s perfect for home use—letting you cycle anytime without disturbing others.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "item_Khf3Qz",
        "item_3HRCNH",
        "item_CTQX6y"
      ],
      "settings": {
